{'symbol': 'ROL', 'date': '2022-07-26 16:30:00', 'title': 'ROLLINS, INC. ANNOUNCES REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND', 'text': 'ATLANTA , JULY 26, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ROLLINS, INC. (NYSE:ROL), A PREMIER GLOBAL CONSUMER AND COMMERCIAL SERVICES\xa0COMPANY ANNOUNCED THAT THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND ON ITS COMMON STOCK OF $0.10 PER SHARE PAYABLE SEPTEMBER 9, 2022 TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON AUGUST 10, 2022. ABOUT ROLLINS, INC. ROLLINS, INC. IS A PREMIER GLOBAL CONSUMER AND COMMERCIAL SERVICES COMPANY.'}